Description: spectrum of a JACK signal, read and never fed
 omx-rta-read reads the spectrum of a processor's signal in a JACK graph,
 what it is given and what it gives, and writes it as log-spaced bands, one
 JSON line ten times a second, for a panel to draw. It is a JACK client with
 input ports only, connected only from the ports it watches, so it never
 feeds the mix. It runs only while something reads it. The window, the
 bands and their gates are the OpenMixer console's, from libomxdsp.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

